usage: clawpatch-supervise [-h] [--repo REPO] [--branch BRANCH]
                           [--push {none,each,final}]
                           [--publish-clawpatch-state]
                           [--trusted-host-codex-sandbox-bypass]
                           [--fresh | --resume-stopped]
                           [--timeout-minutes TIMEOUT_MINUTES]

Visibly process ClawPatch's live queue one current finding at a time.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --repo REPO
  --branch BRANCH
  --push {none,each,final}
  --publish-clawpatch-state
  --trusted-host-codex-sandbox-bypass
  --fresh               start a fresh ClawPatch map/review queue (the default)
  --resume-stopped      resume one exactly checkpoint-owned stopped attempt
                        before continuing its queue
  --timeout-minutes TIMEOUT_MINUTES

